# 130 - aegis-fixwave (device review wave 2026-11-14)
# User-reported fixes on the r70+ build, evidence: aegis-crash
# trap file + screen recording + 2 screenshots.
#   1. Passwords row NPE (null CredentialManagerLauncher in
#      unbranded builds) -> guard + new AegisPasswordsSettings page
#      bound to the pref-backed local-backend toggles.
#   2. Chrome NTP removed: NewTabPage hides its stock layout; the
#      Aegis home overlay is the only new-tab surface.
#   3. Home default wallpaper follows the system theme (day/night
#      aegis tokens) - the forced near-black default made light
#      theme links unreadable.
#   4. Warm theme-aware wallpaper presets replace the cool set.
#   5. Quick-link favicon fallback keeps the first letter (letter
#      tile on the site fallback color; plain circle removed).
#   6. aegis.dev tile -> 'Aegis Search' on the real engine site
#      (patch 098 DSE worker), with a stored-tiles migration.
#   7. Private tab is visible: home status pill swaps to a private
#      line when the current model is incognito.
#   8. Address bar (Top/Bottom) settings entry removed (Aegis has
#      no address bar).
#   9. Dock pill shows aegis://newtab on default pages.
#  10. Tab manager glass panel: normal tabs, native tab groups
#      (TabModel group API) and private tabs with per-tab close,
#      section close-all and new normal/private pills.
